      "deltaSummaryMarkdown": "I inspected the repair delta in Cargo.toml:260-262, crates/gpui_mobile/Cargo.toml:18-20 and crates/gpux_fonts/Cargo.toml:16-17. Only comment lines changed. The root comment now limits the pins to \"apps built in this workspace\", which matches RayX.CLI `Pins::resolve` (the app workspace's `metadata`). None of the three comments states a rayx version any more. The declared values, rayx.assets.toml and rayx_declarations.rs are unchanged, and rayx_declarations still passes 3/3.",
